# Load the first saved world, then walk a long loop, printing stats every second (perf runs).
wait 120
press ENTER
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 30
press ENTER
wait 120
stats
press D 150
press S 150
press A 150
press W 150
stats
press D 150
press S 150
press A 150
press W 150
stats
press D 150
press W 150
stats
quit
